# Canonical line endings: LF in the repo, LF in the worktree.
# (2026-08-28: the tree drifted to CRLF on disk while the index stayed LF,
# producing ~180k lines of EOL churn; `* text=auto eol=lf` pins the policy.)
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never EOL-normalized, never treated as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.flac binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
*.obj binary
*.lib binary
*.a binary
